# engine-room.trk -- "Engine Room". 98 BPM, D minor, 16 rows per bar, 56 bars.
# One Surge Twist plays the whole kit: every row locks the engine (cva:
# kick .863 (pitched up, it is the toms too), snare .929, hi-hat .995,
# filtered noise .599), its first knob (cvb) and its decay (cvd). A second Twist
# plays a ghost kit on free-running 6- and 10-row loops. A third is the
# chord engine, its chord type (cva) and inversion (cvb) locked per chord.
#
#   intro 8 | A 16 | B 16 | break 8 | outro 8

track kk    note len 1                  # 1  silent: the duck's kick trigger
track kit   note vel cva cvb cvd        # 2  Surge Twist, one voice for the kit
track ghost note vel cva cvb            # 3  Surge Twist, the ghost kit
track chord note vel cva cvb            # 4  Surge Twist Chords: type, inversion
track bass  note from chord             # 5  ratsnest reese
track lead  note vel cva                # 6  Surge Twist Inharmonic String: cva = inharmonicity

# Twist's chord types over 0..1: sus4 .2, m .3, m7 .4, m9 .5, m11 .6,
# 6/9 .7, maj9 .8, maj7 .9.
pattern pad 8x16 chord
1:00 | D3  .8 .5 .45        # Dm9
3:00 | Bb2 .7 .9 .55        # Bbmaj7
5:00 | G2  .75 .5 .6        # Gm9
7:00 | A2  .8 .2 .5         # Asus4
8:08 | x   .7 .4            # Am7

pattern stabs 8x16 chord
1:00 | D3:2 .9 .6 .4        # Dm11
1:03 | x:2  .5
1:06 | x:3  .7 .5
1:10 | x:2  .55 .6 .55
2:00 | x:2  .8
2:07 | x:2  .5
2:12 | x:2  .65
3:00 | F2:2 .85 .8 .5       # Fmaj9
3:03 | x:2  .5
3:06 | x:3  .7
3:10 | x:2  .55 .9
4:00 | x:2  .8
4:07 | x:2  .5
4:12 | x:2  .6
5:00 | G2:2 .85 .4 .6       # Gm7
5:03 | x:2  .5
5:06 | x:3  .7 .5
5:10 | x:2  .55
6:00 | x:2  .8
6:07 | x:2  .5
6:12 | x:2  .65
7:00 | Bb2:2 .85 .7 .45     # Bb6/9
7:03 | x:2  .5
7:06 | x:3  .7
7:10 | A2:2 .6 .2 .5        # Asus4
8:00 | x:2  .8 .4           # Am7
8:07 | x:2  .55
8:12 | x:2  .7 .3 .6        # Am, pulling home

pattern bass 2x16 bass
1:00 | t1-12
1:06 | off
1:07 | t1-12
1:10 | t1-5
1:12 | off
1:14 | t1-12
2:03 | off
2:04 | t1
2:06 | ~t1-12
2:10 | t1-10
2:11 | off
2:12 | t1-12

# Kick (F1), snare (C4), hat (A6): a broken beat, two bars.
pattern kit 2x16 kit kk
1:00 | F1 .7 .863 .6 .5       | x
1:02 | A6 .5 .995 .5 .15
1:04 | C4@.04 .9 .929 .6 .42
1:06 | A6 .55 .995 .45 .12
1:07 | F1 .4 .863 .4 .3     | x
1:08 | A6 .6 .995 .5 .15
1:10 | F1 .65 .863 .6 .5      | x
1:11 | A6 .3 .995 .4 .1
1:12 | C4@.06 1 .929 .62 .45
1:14 | A6 .6 .995 .55 .35
1:15 | A6 .45 .995 .5 .35
2:00 | F1 .7 .863 .6 .5       | x
2:02 | A6 .5 .995 .5 .15
2:04 | C4@.04 .9 .929 .6 .42
2:05 | A6 .3 .995 .4 .1
2:06 | F1 .55 .863 .55 .45    | x
2:08 | A6 .6 .995 .5 .15
2:09 | F1 .5 .863 .5 .4      | x
2:10 | D3 .55 .863 .5 .3
2:12 | C4@.06 1 .929 .62 .45
2:13 | A6 .4 .995 .5 .12
2:14 | C4 .35 .929 .4 .2
2:15 | G5 .5 .599 .6 .5

# The intro kit: no snare, the hat opening and closing.
pattern kit_in 2x16 kit kk
1:00 | F1 .5 .863 .7 .6       | x
1:04 | A6 .35 .995 .5 .1
1:06 | A6 .5 .995 .5 .3
1:08 | A6 .3 .995 .45 .2
1:12 | A6 .55 .995 .5 .5
2:00 | F1 .5 .863 .7 .6       | x
2:04 | A6 .35 .995 .5 .1
2:06 | A6 .5 .995 .5 .3
2:10 | D3 .55 .863 .5 .3
2:12 | A6 .6 .995 .5 .65
2:14 | G5 .45 .599 .6 .6

pattern fill 16 kit kk
00 | F1 .7 .863 .6 .5     | x
02 | C4 .5 .929 .5 .3
03 | C4 .6 .929 .5 .3
04 | D3 .55 .863 .5 .3
06 | A2 .55 .863 .5 .3
08 | F1 .65 .863 .6 .5    | x
09 | C4*2 .6 .929 .55 .3
10 | E3 .55 .863 .5 .3
11 | C4*2 .7 .929 .6 .3
12 | B2 .55 .863 .5 .3
13 | C4*3 .8 .929 .6 .3
14 | C4*4 .9 .929 .65 .3
15 | G5 .7 .599 .7 .7

# Ghost kits: modal clicks and hats, by chance, wide.
pattern ghost6 6 ghost
00 | E6 .4 .797 .25
02 | A6?.5 .25 .995 .6
03 | B5@.2 .3 .797 .7
05 | A6?.4 .2 .995 .6

pattern ghost10 10 ghost
00 | A6 .35 .995 .7
01 | x?.5 .2
03 | D6@.1 .35 .797 .3
05 | A6 .3 .995 .65
06 | x?.6 .2
08 | G5@.25 .3 .731 .5
09 | A6?.5 .25 .995 .7

# The lead: inharmonic strings, a struck line, string to bell and back.
pattern lead 8x16 lead
1:00 | D5 .7 .2
1:03 | F5@.05 .5
1:06 | E5 .6 .3
1:10 | A4 .75 .5
2:08 | C5 .5 .25
3:00 | D5 .65 .2
3:04 | F5 .5
3:07 | A5@.08 .6 .6
3:12 | G5 .5 .4
5:00 | Bb4 .7 .3
5:03 | D5@.05 .5
5:06 | C5 .55 .45
5:10 | G4 .7 .7
6:12 | A4 .5 .3
7:00 | E5 .6 .2
7:03 | D5 .5
7:06 | Cs5@.1 .6 .5
7:10 | A4 .7 .8
8:08 | E5 .4 .3

section intro pad+kit_in+ghost6~
section a     stabs+kit+bass+ghost6~
section af    stabs+kit+bass+ghost6~+fill@112
section b     pad+kit+bass+lead+ghost10~
section bf    stabs+kit+bass+lead+ghost10~+fill@112
section brk   pad+lead+ghost10~
section out   stabs+kit_in+bass+ghost6~

order intro a af b bf brk out
